Scope of this licence

The MIT License above covers the source code in this repository only: the
components, styles, configuration, tests and tooling.

It does not cover the content. The content is Copyright (c) 2026 Pedro Barbosa,
all rights reserved, and is not licensed for reuse. The content is:

- The site's text and copy, including the CV, experience, project
  descriptions and about-me writing, wherever it appears in the repository
  (for example the text in src/constants/profile.ts and in the config.ts files
  under src/components/pages/).
- The name "Pedro Barbosa", the pedrobarbosa.pt domain, and any photos,
  logos and icons that identify the site (such as src/app/icon.svg and
  src/app/favicon.ico).
- The visual design of the site and of its share images (the images built
  by src/components/_common/ShareImage and the opengraph-image files under
  src/app/).

You may reuse the code for your own projects, but replace the content with
your own before publishing anything built from it.

